    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "An Unrivalled Sanctuary in the Heart of Foxrock\r\nStepping into this magnificent B-rated duplex penthouse is an exercise in pure elegance. Spanning an incredibly generous 306 sq m (3,294 sq ft), this residence effortlessly marries timeless classic design with high-calibre, modern luxury.\r\nHigh ceilings and light-drenched interiors create an immediate sense of grand scale. Designed for seamless living, with an elevator serving both levels of this expansive home, ensuring ultimate convenience without compromising on style.\r\nThe Lifestyle & Setting.\r\nHollybrook is one of Foxrock's most prestigious developments and this property offers a peaceful retreat from the world. Stroll through the beautifully manicured communal gardens, or take a leisurely walk into the heart of Foxrock village to enjoy its boutique charm.\r\nFive-Star Features & Amenities\r\nLife at 26 Hollybrook is designed to resemble the effortless luxury of a boutique hotel:\r\n24-Hour Concierge: Professional, round-the-clock security and assistance at your service.\r\nGrand Common Areas: Luxuriously appointed, pristine entrance lobbies and corridors.\r\nSecure Parking: Two designated, secure car parking spaces and generous Storage: A double-sized lock-up storage unit to ensure the property is perfectly clutter-free.\r\n\r\nThis prime Foxrock location is adjacent to local village shops with a vibrant café society, boutiques and fine dining. Within easy access is the N11, the M50 and the LUAS. There are a host of recreational facilities close by including Foxrock Golf Club, Carrickmines Lawn Tennis & Croquet Club and Leopardstown Racecourse."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Reception Hall with feature timber floor opening to:\r\n\r\nStudy Area with attractive panelled walls to dado level. Radiator cover and decorative window shutters.\r\n\r\nCloaks Press\r\nGuest Cloakroom White suite incorporating w.h.b. in granite surround with large wall mirror and w.c.. Tiled floor.\r\n\r\nDrawing Room/Dining Room\r\n7.95m x 6.52m. This superb room has a delightful dual aspect. Feature stone fireplace with inset and hearth, fitted with gas coal effect fire. Decorative radiator covers.\r\n\r\nSitting Room\r\n6.87m x 4.70m. with decorative window shutters and radiator covers.\r\nNew custom made double doors to:\r\n\r\nKitchen/Breakfast Room\r\n5.26m x 3.12m. Excellent range of new bespoke units incorporating breakfast bar, stainless steel eye level double oven, ceramic hob, extractor, sink, stainless steel microwave, integrated new fridge freezer, integrated dishwasher and quality marble work top areas. Tiled floor.\r\n\r\nUtility Room\r\n4.76m x 2.35m. Fitted units with marble worktop, sink, washing machine and dryer. Tiled floor.\r\nLarge walk in Airing Room with insulated water cylinder. Staircase to upper level.\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom 1\r\n8.88m x 7.64m with decorative radiator covers.\r\n\r\nDressing Room En Suite\r\n3.60m x 1.71m\r\nShoe Room\r\n\r\nBathroom En Suite\r\n4.37m x 1.71m White suite incorporating bath with telephone shower attachment with tiled surround, large wall mirror, w.h.b. in granite surround with wall mirror, tiled power shower, w.c. and heated towel rail. Tiled floor.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\n6.30m x 5.28m with double fitted wardrobes. Dual aspect.\r\nShower Room En Suite\r\n2.93m x 1.70m. White suite incorporating tiled power shower, w.h.b. with wall mirror, w.c. and heated towel rail. Tiled floor.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\n3.24m x 2.92m. with fitted wardrobes\r\n\r\nBedroom 4\r\n3.99m x 3.17m.\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom\r\n2.93m x 1.70m. White suite incorporating bath with t shower attachment, tiled surround, wall mirror, w.h.b. in granite surround with large wall mirror, w.c. and heated towel rail. Tiled floor.\r\n\r\nOUTSIDE\r\nSet behind wrought iron electronic gates this tranquil sylvan environs situated on leafy Brighton Road in the heart of olde Foxrock, Hollybrook stands proud amidst cultivated gardens. The cobblelock driveway gives access to the 2 designated underground car parking spaces and the personal double lock-up storage unit."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Bright and spacious accommodation of 306 sq m (3,294 sq ft)\r\n· Stylishly appointed interiors presented in superb walk-in condition\r\n· Rooms of elegant dimensions with feature high ceilings\r\n· Quality high specification throughout\r\n· 24 hour Concierge service\r\n· Two designated underground car parking spaces\r\n· Large Lock up storage unit in basement\r\n· On site gymnasium and sauna\r\n· Gas fired central heating with 20 new radiators and boiler\r\n· Video intercom system\r\n· High level of security and electronic gates\r\n· Recessed lighting\r\n· Lift service to both floors"
